repetition (5,1)        weights 0:1 5:1; d = 5, detects 4, corrects 2
even parity (6,5)       weights 0:1 2:15 4:15 6:1; d = 2, detects 1, corrects 0
Hamming (7,4)           weights 0:1 3:7 4:7 7:1; d = 3, detects 2, corrects 1
extended Hamming (8,4)  weights 0:1 4:14 8:1; d = 4, detects 3, corrects 1
short code (6,3)        weights 0:1 3:4 4:3; d = 3, detects 2, corrects 1
